      "description": {
        "fun": "Deerling's fur changes colour and scent with the seasons: pink and sweet in spring, green and grassy in summer, orange in autumn, and brown, with hardly any scent at all, in winter. People use it to mark the turning of the year. It looks adorable, but farmers see it as a pest because it eats every plant shoot, so some post Lycanroc to guard their fields. Its playful headbutts sting a little, thanks to antlers hidden under its flower.",
        "guide": "Deerling is a Normal- and Grass-type fawn Pokémon whose fur changes colour and scent with the season, giving it Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter forms. It evolves into Sawsbuck.",
