      "description": {
        "fun": "Sawsbuck's antlers follow the seasons, sprouting pink flowers in spring, thick leaves in summer, red foliage in autumn and a coat of snow in winter, so people can tell the time of year just by looking. Herds migrate with the seasons, led by the stag with the most splendid antlers. Its summer leaves can be brewed into black tea. Autumn Sawsbuck are notoriously short-tempered, while the Winter Form is the least popular with fans.",
        "guide": "Sawsbuck is the evolved form of Deerling, a Normal- and Grass-type deer Pokémon whose antlers change with the season. It has Spring, Summer, Autumn and Winter forms and lives in herds that migrate.",
